WEBVTT

00:00:08,750 --> 00:00:15,310
Just a Rebuilder. Rebuilder is that unit, that little electrical unit that helps with neuropathy.

00:00:15,310 --> 00:00:22,910
I purchased a Rebuilder to address neuropathy from Kibo. On your website you tell those who

00:00:22,910 --> 00:00:28,270
purchased the item to buy a divided container to use with a Rebuilder. Yes, one of those

00:00:28,270 --> 00:00:33,790
little divided buckets that you'd get at Walmart that you'd carry your cleaning supplies around with,

00:00:33,790 --> 00:00:38,590
or your gardening supplies around with. It's like a bucket on each side of the handle in the middle.

00:00:39,550 --> 00:00:44,750
So I did that. I read the complete directions to the Rebuilder and it says nothing about using a

00:00:44,750 --> 00:00:52,270
divided container. So I'm confused what's the purpose of needing that. So I don't know why

00:00:52,270 --> 00:00:57,870
the Rebuilder doesn't have that data, but you have to use a divided container fill both sides up with

00:00:57,870 --> 00:01:05,790
water. Use the rubberized leads. Connect that to the lead itself, the little rubber pads. You drop

00:01:05,790 --> 00:01:10,830
the rubber pads in each side of the water, put your feet in there, and then you turn the thing up

00:01:10,830 --> 00:01:20,670
and tell your comfort level is comfortable. And any 15 to 30 minutes is recommended. Typically they've

00:01:20,670 --> 00:01:28,910
done studies on it. Even though I think they recommend 30 minutes per session, 90% of the treatment is

00:01:28,910 --> 00:01:38,830
done in the first 15 minutes so it depends on what your time frame is.

